@* Shared by the /terms page and the checkout terms dialog, so there is one source of truth. *@
<div class="terms-content">
    <p>These terms apply to orders placed on this demo store.</p>
    <h2>Prices</h2>
    <p>All prices are in Indian rupees and include applicable taxes. The price you pay is the total shown when you place the order;
       if a price changes while items are in your cart, we ask you to accept the new total before you can check out.</p>
    <h2>Orders and stock</h2>
    <p>Your order is confirmed once the stock for every item has been reserved. If any item cannot be supplied, the whole order is
       declined, nothing is charged and your cart is kept. Signed photographs are limited editions, limited to two per order.</p>
    <h2>Delivery and payment</h2>
    <p>Delivery is free on orders of ₹999.00 or more; otherwise a flat ₹99.00 applies. Payment is collected in cash on delivery.</p>
    <h2>Your details</h2>
    <p>We use your name, delivery address and mobile number only to deliver your order. They are stored with the order and are not shared.</p>
    <h2>Returns</h2>
    <p>Returns and cancellations are not available in this demo store.</p>
</div>
